<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 199-3 V MATABELELAND AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 199-3 V MATABELELAND AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 199 for three at the close of play on the first day of the four day match against Matabeleland on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
